1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,700
Don't get so close yet.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:03,800
But I don't want him to leave either.

3
00:00:05,833 --> 00:00:07,300
I'll head out so I don't keep you.

4
00:00:08,966 --> 00:00:11,633
Let's swap numbers. Don't keep me waiting when we go out.

5
00:00:13,033 --> 00:00:14,533
Sure, reach out if you need anything.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,733
Sura, activate his guest card. Don't tell him who I am yet.

7
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:21,233
What if he asks?

8
00:00:23,133 --> 00:00:23,766
I'll tell him myself.

9
00:00:25,966 --> 00:00:28,366
I've got the art supplies. I'd like to stay a few more days.

10
00:00:29,066 --> 00:00:32,333
Ah Tan left orders. You no longer need approval to go out.

11
00:00:37,066 --> 00:00:37,400
Nawin.

12
00:00:38,166 --> 00:00:39,400
Get in on the left. Let's get you out of the rain.

13
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:41,566
Just take me to the guest room. Don't go out of your way.

14
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:46,966
You're soaked. Dry off at my place before heading back.

15
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:49,833
Yeah, going to your place first is fine.

16
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:54,866
I'll head back once the rain eases. I won't stay long.

17
00:01:02,466 --> 00:01:05,000
Let's get inside. You can't keep getting soaked like this.

18
00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:12,233
A little rain won't hurt me. Don't worry.

19
00:01:13,300 --> 00:01:14,266
I'll just dry off and leave.

20
00:01:18,833 --> 00:01:22,366
You clearly want to be near me.
Why leave the second we get here?

21
00:01:24,566 --> 00:01:24,800
Wait.

22
00:01:25,466 --> 00:01:27,233
I came to get out of the rain, not to agree to this.

23
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:27,733
Let go!

24
00:01:28,300 --> 00:01:28,866
You're Thanat's man.

25
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:30,233
Ah Tan, don't do this.

26
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:37,033
I told you to stop! What gives you the right to kiss me?
